      "title": "editcap: if -T was specified, change the linktype of all interfaces.",
      "message": "editcap: if -T was specified, change the linktype of all interfaces.\n\nDon't just change the linktype of the file (if it has one) and the\nlinktypes of all the packets, change the linktype of all interfaces as\nwell.\n\nFixes #17520.\n",
